jectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about food, eating and meals in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drive-in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where people can watch movies outdoors while sitting in their cars"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to go to the drive-in across from the park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear about places in a city."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to go jogging"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to run as a form of exercise "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some people prefer to go jogging on the boardwalk for exercise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to do yoga"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to practice yoga; to take a yoga class "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to do yoga on a Saturday morning in the park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to watch movies "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to see a movie "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to watch movies at the theater."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to go salsa dancing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a dance from South America "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Want to go salsa dancing?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le01ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Descriptive Writing / Paragraph "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Descriptive paragraphs can describe things to do in your city. You use Infinitives to make writing more descriptive and interesting to read. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Topic sentence:  Cambridge is a small town but there is so much to do. </br>Supporting Sentence: I like to go the galleries and museums on James Blvd.</br>Concluding Sentence: I love living in Cambridge."}, {"type": "text", "content": "To write a descriptive paragraph:<br /> <br />A topic:<br /> the person, place, or thing your description is about<br />  The main idea about the topic: <br />the opinion or observation that you will develop and support in the body sentences"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Supporting Sentences: <br />Support and develop your topic by giving: <br />Background information <br /> Descriptive details"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Concluding Sentence: <br />Summarize the idea in a different way. <br />Some writers may use words in conclusion, all in all,or in summary to signal the ending."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Simple Tense for Descriptions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use the Present Simple to talk about actions that happen again and again.  </br>We use the Present Simple to talk about things that are true all the time.</br>We use the Present Simple to talk about feelings and thoughts.</br>We use the Simple Present in the interrogative form to ask questions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Cambridge is a wonderful place to live."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Salsa lessons are on Friday nights."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I love this city."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you like Cambridge?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Is there a lot to do in Cambridge?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What is your favorite part about the city?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Do research on a city. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find 5 attractions you can talk about."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose 5 adjectives to describe the attractions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your paragraph with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I start with a topic sentence in a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use descriptive words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use supporting sentences in a paragraph about a city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I finish with a concluding sentence in a paragraph about a city."}]}], "type": "sena"}